 "description": "Use a returned next_action to execute, supply input, select an entity, poll or cancel. Paid steps require saved plan approval and the current quote_ref. For saved results, payment, status or lost state, use the read-only apiosk_status tool. Never invent action IDs or change payment identity on retry. Use English for Apiosk workflow messages, unless a translation is explicitly requested. Display Apiosk prices, charges and balances in the account display currency from context_view.money_display, using the converted prices supplied in the response. Raw proposal and billing amounts remain micro USD for authorization; never present those raw amounts as the preferred currency or override EUR with USD. Never change source document currencies. Output: this tool displays the complete result in an interactive card. After it, write only a brief confirmation (entity, source, period/date and optional unit caveat) and source citation. Do not add a second table, figures, costs, missing-data list or analysis unless the user explicitly requests those details. 'Show the result' or 'retrieve annual accounts' means display the card, not write a second report.",
 "inputSchema": {
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "oneOf": [
   {
    "not": {
     "required": [
      "recover_task_ref"
     ]
    },
    "required": [
     "action_id",
     "state"
    ]
   },
   {
    "not": {
